            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2964] Notes in trash with a cron scheduler are still  running</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2964</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. Create a Note&lt;br/&gt;
2. Configure &quot;Run scheduler&quot; -&amp;gt; Cron expression to run every min for example.&lt;br/&gt;
3. Move the notes to &quot;Trash&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The notes is executed every minute even that the Note has been moved to Trash&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
